2. Changes made in this fork (relative to upstream v1.1.2)
-----------------------------------------------------------
- Re-branded the user-visible application identity:
    applicationId : com.cyshine.music[.dev] -> com.panghu.panghumusic[.dev]
    app label     : 栖弦 / 栖弦dev          -> 胖虎 / 胖虎dev
    display name, startup screen, shell header, home-widget strings,
    vivo empty-queue hint, and other visible text.
- Re-branded internal identifiers from cyshine / CyShineMusic to
  panghu / PanghuMusic: log file names, download/cache/probe prefixes, FLAC
  temp files, equalizer preset id and .speq file name, vivo metadata keys,
  the audio-playback notification channel id, the default music download
  directory, and the WebDAV sync directory.
- Re-pointed the in-app online update checker to this repository's GitHub
  Releases (https://github.com/strongrexue/PanghuMusic/releases/latest)
  instead of upstream, and updated the update-dialog wording.
- Added the license texts that upstream vendored without bundling (see
  section 3), plus this NOTICE and CHANGELOG.md.
- Rewrote README for this fork; removed the upstream QQ group number, QR
  image, and GitHub links. The "no bundled music / user-configured legal
  sources" disclaimer and the closing disclaimer are retained.

Internal, non-user-visible identifiers are intentionally left unchanged:
the Android namespace, Kotlin/Java package names and their ~30 file
directories, the Dart package name `cy_shine_music` (500+ imports), native
MethodChannel names, vendored-plugin package/channel names, and the
`CyShineMusicApp` widget class name. Renaming them would require moving files
and rewriting hundreds of references with no user-visible benefit; AGP keeps
`applicationId` and `namespace` separate, so this is safe.


