6. Modifications to vendored GPL files (GPLv3 section 5(a))
------------------------------------------------------------
This fork modifies the following GPL-3.0-only files vendored under
packages/prism_ui (see section 3), to add a single app-wide glass-style
injection hook used by the "玻璃设置" feature:

  packages/prism_ui/lib/liquid_glass.dart
    - `LiquidGlassScope` gains an optional `styleTransform` callback plus
      `styleTransformOf(BuildContext)`; `updateShouldNotify` compares it.

  packages/prism_ui/lib/liquid_glass_capture.dart  (part of the above)
    - `LiquidGlassHost.build` reads the callback and threads it through
      `_LiquidGlassHostBox` -> `_RenderLiquidGlassHost` ->
      `_LiquidGlassHostLayer`; `_gather` applies it to every pane's style.

Both modified files carry an SPDX header and an inline note. Changes are
dated 2026-11-13. No shader (.frag) files, GLSL constants, or uniform
packing were changed. The complete Corresponding Source for these changes
is published in this repository (see section 4).
